; ----------------------------------------------------------------
;  MAIN -- Contents page
; ----------------------------------------------------------------

@NODE Main "SpecBAS Reference Manual"
@{JCENTER}@{b}SpecBAS Reference Manual@{ub}
@{JLEFT}

SpecBAS is a modern, extended implementation of Sinclair BASIC for the PC, designed to be familiar to programmers of the 8-bit era whilst being powerful enough for serious software development. Press @{b}F1@{ub} in the editor with the cursor over any keyword or function name to jump directly to its help page.

@{b}Getting Started@{ub}

