@NODE Appendix_Errors "Appendix C: Error Messages"
@{b}Appendix C - Error Messages@{ub}

Error codes are returned by @{b}ERRORNUM@{ub} and @{b}ERROR$@{ub}. In messages below, @{b}%v@{ub} is replaced at runtime with the name of the offending variable, file, or item.

